# SalekhPos — root .dockerignore
# The backend and web Dockerfiles use the repo root as the build context.

# Build artefacts
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/.vite
**/.cache
**/.parcel-cache
**/.next
**/.nuxt
**/.svelte-kit

# Test / coverage
**/TestResults
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# Logs / runtime
**/*.log
**/logs
**/.eslintcache
**/.prettiercache
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets — never copy
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/appsettings.Development.local.json
**/webhook-secrets.*
**/jwt-*
**/*.secret

# IDE / OS
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.cursor
**/.copilot
**/.aider*
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

# Documentation that doesn't belong in an image
**/docs/
**/README.md
**/CONTRIBUTING.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/LICENSE
